### Is the API up?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Companies (the dev profile seeds "Demo Signs & Print" as company 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies

### Create a company (leave fields out to get SA defaults)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Test Company",
  "saturdayStart": "09:00",
  "saturdayEnd": "13:00"
}

### Staff of company 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/employees

### Add an employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sam",
  "lastName": "Daniels",
  "phone": "082 555 1234"
}

### Work locations the phone watches (geofences)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/locations

### Clients
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/clients

### Pick or add a client from the phone (same name twice = same client)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "harbour cafe"
}

### Lee's month: the heatmap data (leave out ?month for the current month)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1/attendance

### Last month
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1/attendance?month=2026-10

### Boss live feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/feed?limit=20

### Phone sync. Run it twice: the second time it comes back DUPLICATE and nothing is saved twice.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sync/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "events": [
    {
      "eventUuid": "9b2f6a8e-3c41-4d7a-a5e2-1f0c7d9b4e21",
      "type": "SITE_ARRIVE",
      "source": "MANUAL",
      "occurredAt": "2026-11-24T08:30:00Z",
      "latitude": -33.0812,
      "longitude": 18.0291,
      "clientId": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Validation error: 400 with a clear reason
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Hours",
  "weekdayStart": "17:00",
  "weekdayEnd": "08:00"
}
